Subject: [PATCH 04050/11362] [outer-loop] ledger: record energy-as-RFT-teacher
 as DO-NOT-RE-OPEN (already tried on ARC + retired)

Adversarial audit wf_88e2a7a7-2fe (9 agents, refuted_count=1 on framing only)
overturns the earlier 'fresh fit' read. energy-as-RFT-teacher is NOT novel-for-ARC:
- exp4100 (.379 TRM verifier-RFT headline) = verifier-certified RFT on the nano-TRM
  ARC dynamics engine, operator-RETIRED by name (feedback_trm_training_retired);
- exp4077-4089 ARC code-induction RFT = all BLOCKED;
- exp4212 ARC-generator distill-lift = 0.0;
- only Sudoku +1.1% positive, and there 'energy' is the TRUE oracle not a learned energy.
Two offline-immune blockers: chance-level cross-game transition certifier (macro-AUROC
0.5442 vs vote 0.9235, strict-subset hit-set) + the headroom/generation wall empties the
certified-correct training set (exp4737 0/100 solved). Post-deadline item only, gated on
the oracle-distinct structural energy (DiffusionGemma/GAP-ARCH-FEATURES, STILL-PENDING).

